
  <sn><md>### Set up Sublime for C

Setting up Sublime Text for C development on Linux is very straightforward. Since you already have the GCC compiler installed from your previous setup, you primarily need to configure Sublime Text's **Build System** to use it .

Here’s a step-by-step guide to get you compiling and running C code directly from the editor.
</md></sn>
